# XWING.EXE from a fresh copy with the DOS clock set to 1 February 1993 12:00:00. The
# copy-protection dialog cycles glyph triples until a key freezes one; at these emulated
# times it shows manual page 16's left code (EHAPAH). The answer leads to registration.
mode 13
# Enter skips the intro
delay 5000
key enter
delay 20000
key enter
delay 3000
vga question.vga
key e h a p a h enter
delay 3000
vga answered.vga
mode 13
done
